Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:09.00,zhu,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}本字幕由豌豆字幕組製作 僅供學習交流 禁止用於商業用途
Comment: 0,0:04:47.02,0:04:47.06,op-jp,,0,0,0,,==========OP==========
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.87,0:04:53.15,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}冷え冷えと蒼褪める夜に僕ら
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.44,0:04:57.74,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}凍えて　灯火探した
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.16,0:05:10.17,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}信じてきたことが全部嘘だとしたら
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.38,0:05:16.24,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}存在意義が揺らぐ　そんな気がしたんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.56,0:05:22.59,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}だけど成したことと成せなかった事実に
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.59,0:05:25.64,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}仄かな動機が宿る
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.64,0:05:28.56,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}それを信じるよ
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:33.23,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}悲劇の始まりだとしても
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.42,0:05:37.65,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}僕は何度でも君を選ぶ
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.33,0:05:45.35,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}疑うことが僕らを引き裂いたから
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.35,0:05:50.04,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}片っぽに互いの約束、結わえて
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.04,0:05:53.12,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}ほどけない手と手、結び目
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.12,0:05:57.60,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}誰かの願いの下に産れたんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.60,0:06:05.39,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}それなら生きとし生けるものに　備わる痛覚が愛って
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.39,0:06:08.33,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}知りながら僕は痛む
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.33,0:06:14.28,op-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}君の笑みの名残　明日の轍に降り積む
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.87,0:04:53.15,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}在冰冷蒼白的黑夜裡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.44,0:04:57.74,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}我們瑟瑟發抖 尋找著燈火
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.16,0:05:10.17,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}如果堅信之物全都是謊言
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.38,0:05:16.24,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}那我的存在意義 或將產生動搖
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.56,0:05:22.59,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}但在成功與失敗之中
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.59,0:05:25.64,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}宿有些微動機
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.64,0:05:28.56,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}我選擇相信它
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:33.23,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}即使將開啟悲劇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.42,0:05:37.65,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}我也會無數次選擇你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.33,0:05:45.35,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}因為懷疑會將我們拆散
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.35,0:05:50.04,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}單方面將二人的約定交纏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.04,0:05:53.12,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}手與手 線與線 已無法解開
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.12,0:05:57.60,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}我們都是在期望中誕生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.60,0:06:05.39,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}那麼 有生之物皆具備的痛覺便是愛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.39,0:06:08.33,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}我雖然知曉 卻依然疼痛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.33,0:06:14.28,op-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}你的笑影紛飛 飄落於明天的車轍
Comment: 0,0:22:04.97,0:22:05.01,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,==========ED==========
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.44,0:22:19.11,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}やっと判りはじめた　気がしているんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.92,0:22:26.45,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}揺れる　螺旋階段　逃げ出すことはできないんだと
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.77,0:22:37.96,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}今はただ　頭ん中　空っぽにして進めばいい
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.17,0:22:47.44,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HEFA281&}もう認めてしまおう　もうこの弱さも全て
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.44,0:22:54.17,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HEFA281&}自分自身だろう　そうだろう　向き合うときだろう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.17,0:23:02.24,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HBEA35F&}もう受け止めてあげよう　痛みと手を繋ぎ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.24,0:23:04.02,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HBEA35F&}重なり　交わる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.02,0:23:09.77,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HBEA35F&}再編成の意思を　塗り変えよう
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.12,0:23:18.34,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HB5866B&}もう認めてしまおう　もうこの弱さも全て
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.34,0:23:27.42,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HB5866B&}自問自答して　見つけた答えに　嘘はないんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.42,0:23:33.75,ed-jp,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HB7CB86&}きっと　まだ何も始まってないんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.44,0:22:19.11,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}我似乎終於開始明白
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.92,0:22:26.45,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}無法逃離那搖晃的螺旋階梯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.77,0:22:37.96,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)}現在只需要 放空腦袋向前走
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.17,0:22:47.44,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HEFA281&}就讓我承認吧 這份軟弱和一切
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.44,0:22:54.17,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HEFA281&}全都是我自己 沒錯吧 是時候直面了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.17,0:23:02.24,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HBEA35F&}就讓我接受吧 和痛楚手牽手
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.24,0:23:04.02,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HBEA35F&}重疊 交織
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.02,0:23:09.77,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HBEA35F&}將重新編寫的想法 全部塗改掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.12,0:23:18.34,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HB5866B&}就讓我承認吧 這份軟弱和一切
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.34,0:23:27.42,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HB5866B&}自問自答找到的答案 絕非虛假
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.42,0:23:33.75,ed-cn,,0,0,0,,{\blur5\fad(200,200)\3c&HB7CB86&}一定還什麼都沒有開始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.02,0:00:05.99,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正细雅宋_GBK\fad(1061,0)\shad3\bord0.1\an3\fs60\pos(1833.34,925.33)}第4集{\fsp3}「撒旦覺醒」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.03,0:01:39.04,zhu,,0,0,0,,證婚人休息室
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.78,0:12:37.78,zhu,,0,0,0,,殺鬼酒館
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.98,0:23:39.98,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正细雅宋_GBK\shad3\bord0.1\fs50\b1\pos(960,786.18)}下集{\fs30}\N\N{\fs60\fsp3}「比身體更重要的東西」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.82,0:00:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,頭好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.41,0:00:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,宿醉了？你喝太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那是叫什麼派對來著
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.37,0:00:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,單身派對？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.61,0:00:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,利克使勁給我灌酒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.79,0:00:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,而且他不管怎麼喝都喝不醉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.50,0:00:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我無奈之下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.18,0:00:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,就把除他之外的人全灌醉了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.22,0:00:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你搞什麼啊 要是毀了婚禮怎麼辦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.85,0:00:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,利克只有喝酒厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,和他喝酒還不賴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.98,0:00:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 你這領帶怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.84,0:00:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,就不能繫好一點嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.44,0:00:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,只在這種時候繫好一點也沒用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.16,0:01:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不知道怎麼繫吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.54,0:01:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我給你重新系
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.82,0:01:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.89,0:01:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,把領子立起來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.32,0:01:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你這小鬼還挺熟練啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.20,0:01:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,小鬼？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.36,0:01:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,就是小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.94,0:01:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,明明是大人 卻連領帶都不會繫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.97,0:01:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,會繫領帶就是大人了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.64,0:01:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不會繫領帶但是會耍嘴皮子就是大人了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.84,0:01:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你好煩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.09,0:01:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好 繫好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.56,0:01:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧 婚禮要開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.02,0:01:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,利克 恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.60,0:01:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,小卷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.31,0:02:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我們真的成為大人了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.02,0:02:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.42,0:02:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,大人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.02,0:03:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是想要嗎 給你了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.41,0:03:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.70,0:03:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,要拍了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.29,0:03:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,真是場不錯的婚禮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.90,0:03:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你都說多少次了 喝醉了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.30,0:03:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,這可是利克的婚禮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.00,0:03:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,自己爭取到了幸福 真厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.74,0:03:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不過 不只是利克
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.24,0:03:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我開始編寫教材
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.14,0:03:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你一邊執行任務 一邊在驅魔塾教書
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.33,0:03:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然態度冷淡 但學生都很崇拜你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.90,0:03:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,態度冷淡是多餘的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.57,0:03:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那個時候 我根本想不到會有現在
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.94,0:04:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,大家真的…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.78,0:04:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,都是我的寶物
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.15,0:04:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你確實是大人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.40,0:04:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼什麼？你小聲說了重要的話吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.17,0:04:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你說了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.18,0:04:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,煩死了 沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.55,0:04:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,告訴我啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.19,0:06:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,路西法
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.59,0:06:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,這座設施和研究 都快堅持不下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.62,0:06:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,請你捨棄對物質的執著吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.87,0:06:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.42,0:06:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,想要構建一個充滿溫柔光芒的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.09,0:06:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,一個人人平等的公平世界
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.53,0:07:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,拜託你了 謝米哈薩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.10,0:07:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要身體…需要能動的身體
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.52,0:07:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,也給我…希望之光吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.22,0:07:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不 路西法
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.42,0:07:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以改變世界的法則
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.54,0:07:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你這樣也算人類嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.21,0:07:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,在我就任這個職位時 就已經捨棄了人情
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.70,0:07:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.24,0:07:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,阿瑪依蒙好像找到了新的依附體
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.09,0:07:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,下一個…下一個一定會…輪到我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.64,0:07:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,否則就太不合理了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.02,0:08:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是那個實驗體
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.52,0:08:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,阿撒瀉勒So-005
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.80,0:08:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,有惡魔依附進去了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.14,0:08:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.69,0:08:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼把我叫回來了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.65,0:08:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,為了保密
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.72,0:08:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,而且也缺人手
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.62,0:08:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,總之你先看看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.48,0:08:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,咬郎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.08,0:08:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,讓他冷靜 注射鎮定劑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.20,0:09:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,快退後
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.07,0:09:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不好 要逃了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.41,0:09:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.84,0:09:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那是個什麼惡魔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.35,0:09:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,累了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.93,0:09:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,尤莉 去喝一杯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.87,0:09:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,獅郎說今天來不了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.42,0:09:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我也得在明天前出好試卷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.40,0:09:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我答應了他的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.85,0:09:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,真是會使喚你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.41,0:09:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,別什麼都答應 這是壞習慣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.52,0:09:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.96,0:10:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.67,0:10:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,燐火？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.74,0:10:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,獅郎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.50,0:10:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不是他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.72,0:10:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,別過來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.27,0:10:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,放開我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.94,0:10:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,尤…莉…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.54,0:10:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,燐火？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.12,0:10:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.70,0:10:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.36,0:10:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,尤…莉…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.96,0:10:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.08,0:11:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,帶回去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.22,0:11:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你是驅魔師吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.45,0:11:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.36,0:11:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 跟我們走一趟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.97,0:11:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他為什麼會去找這名女子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.50,0:11:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我們正在審訊她
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.73,0:11:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,她也有可能是碰巧被捲進來的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.24,0:11:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,尤…莉…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.59,0:11:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.68,0:11:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.49,0:11:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他不會又…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.01,0:11:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,尤…莉…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.63,0:11:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,開槍
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.53,0:11:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.37,0:12:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,尤莉…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.74,0:12:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.62,0:12:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,乖孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.40,0:12:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,聽話了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.76,0:12:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.58,0:12:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,看來很喜歡她啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.30,0:12:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,聽說她是很優秀的手騎士啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.04,0:12:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,請她協助怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.80,0:12:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不先把他馴服 就一切無從談起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.16,0:12:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我要兼任第13部門的工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.08,0:12:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.38,0:12:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的是個傻子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.72,0:12:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你也要在第13部門工作吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.29,0:12:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我原本就跟那裡有淵源
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.86,0:12:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,第13部門的事 我已經接受過培訓了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.26,0:13:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是在那裡出生的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.32,0:13:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼要摻和進來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.28,0:13:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是因為淵源
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.41,0:13:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那孩子是我兒時的玩伴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.39,0:13:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 你真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.53,0:13:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,沒想到他會依附在人身上出現
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.82,0:13:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,沒想到他會是這麼高級的惡魔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.72,0:13:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他已經殺了好幾個人 卻沒有自知
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.78,0:13:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是個擁有強大力量的嬰兒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.52,0:13:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能不管
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.88,0:13:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,就因為你會這樣跟惡魔扯上關係
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.30,0:13:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,才會越陷越深
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.86,0:13:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,真的會死的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.54,0:13:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,有事找我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.36,0:13:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.15,0:13:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,尤莉？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.60,0:13:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,喂喂喂 怎麼了 吵架了？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.06,0:13:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,利克 怎麼這就醉了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.40,0:14:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你在搞什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.25,0:14:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.67,0:14:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你明明很喜歡她
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.83,0:14:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,別看尤莉那樣 其實很受歡迎的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.05,0:14:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,她要是被別人搶走了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.98,0:14:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不管啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.84,0:14:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,兄長
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.75,0:14:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你認為那個新來的是什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.78,0:14:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他連通著世間一切事物
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.17,0:14:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你應該也感覺到了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.91,0:14:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那是孕育了我們的…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.51,0:14:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,森羅萬象本身
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.55,0:14:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我開動了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.20,0:14:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我開動了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.42,0:14:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.99,0:15:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,快擦擦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.45,0:15:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.70,0:15:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,蘋果
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.67,0:15:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,答對了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.78,0:15:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那這個呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.94,0:15:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,企鵝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.06,0:15:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,答對了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.72,0:15:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,47加32等於？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.76,0:15:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,79
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.15,0:15:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,549加64等於？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.65,0:15:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,613
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.50,0:15:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,46乘9
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.34,0:15:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,414
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.05,0:15:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,523除以6
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.81,0:15:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,87.16666…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.89,0:15:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好無聊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.00,0:15:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,出點更難的題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.78,0:15:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害 轉眼就吸收了知識
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.80,0:15:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,這個也膩了 雖然很喜歡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.31,0:15:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.33,0:15:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼要做這麼殘忍的事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.46,0:15:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,只是試了一下能不能開孔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.48,0:16:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,一直跟我待在一起啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.92,0:16:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.12,0:16:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,理性和情感無法短時間培養出來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.45,0:16:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,能一個人看家可是很帥的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.18,0:16:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我肯定會稱讚你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.67,0:16:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,尤莉 你會高興？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.75,0:16:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.34,0:16:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要回來啊 不然我不會原諒你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.28,0:16:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,一年三個月過去了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.26,0:16:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他的不平衡越來越顯得危險
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.85,0:16:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,提高教育水平吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.08,0:16:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫人送新教材和書本過來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.86,0:16:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.19,0:16:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不增長經驗而只給他大量知識很危險
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.83,0:16:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,必須拓寬他的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.18,0:16:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,能不能讓我之外的人 也和他接觸呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.93,0:16:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,這才更危險吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.62,0:16:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他去年殺死了那麼多職員
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.31,0:17:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不認為有人願意和他接觸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.75,0:17:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,也對…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.04,0:17:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是覺得這樣比站在外面看著更有意義
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.84,0:17:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.46,0:17:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.15,0:17:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你別誤會
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.96,0:17:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,要是出了意外 我就殺死他
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.72,0:17:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,燐火 今天有外面的人來玩了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.84,0:17:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫獅郎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.60,0:17:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不許靠近尤莉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.02,0:17:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎麼了 獅郎什麼也不會做哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.28,0:17:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 我不知道為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.20,0:17:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 我討厭你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.23,0:17:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.65,0:17:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就一個人玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.16,0:18:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,這個好懷念啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.58,0:18:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我的 不許碰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.62,0:18:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,玩一下下又沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.94,0:18:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,這個很難 你肯定玩不好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.31,0:18:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你看著吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.96,0:18:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,很簡單
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.10,0:18:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我也來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.41,0:18:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,沒進
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.64,0:18:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,要這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.24,0:18:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要玩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.69,0:18:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,菜鳥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.27,0:18:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,獅郎 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.72,0:18:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,燐火 不可以向別人撒氣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.56,0:18:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.17,0:18:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,輸了很不甘心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.88,0:18:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你想怎麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.88,0:18:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我想贏
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.09,0:18:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我想贏過他
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.44,0:18:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那就練習吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.79,0:18:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,變得比獅郎厲害就行了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.28,0:19:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,唉 塊頭跟我一樣大卻哭哭啼啼的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.76,0:19:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我不喜歡小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.16,0:19:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你不也是 像個小孩一樣挑釁他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.44,0:19:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我已經決定不會輸給惡魔了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.24,0:19:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.46,0:19:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你要這麼說 那我就不來了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.81,0:19:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,來啊 來陪陪他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.81,0:19:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,今天燐火一定也學到了東西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.09,0:19:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,真沒辦法 算你欠我個人情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.11,0:19:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 再見
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.40,0:19:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 燐火 把玩具收起來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.49,0:19:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,贏過他 贏過他 贏過他…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.99,0:19:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,下次我絕對要贏
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.18,0:19:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.04,0:19:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,明天見
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.45,0:20:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我說 艾金很可愛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.62,0:20:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是在跟藤本獅郎交往啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.90,0:20:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.67,0:20:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.92,0:20:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,緊急情況 005破壞了大門
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.96,0:20:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,出什麼事了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.38,0:20:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,艾金 對不起 是我批准的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.34,0:20:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他以看守為人質 要我們給他書
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.79,0:20:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,要我們在你來之前 盡可能給他情報
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.84,0:20:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼會這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.62,0:20:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然我一開始很擔心 但目前他還沒殺人質
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.67,0:20:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我去和他談 要他放了人質
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.02,0:21:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,燐火
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.80,0:21:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,燐火？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.78,0:21:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好懷念的名字啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.17,0:21:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,放了這個人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.06,0:21:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,這人已經沒用了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.30,0:21:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.85,0:21:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你嚇了一跳嗎 尤莉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.49,0:21:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,真有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.57,0:21:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我已經和昨天不一樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.42,0:21:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,獲得了這裡的所有知識 我終於確信了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.95,0:21:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我這一存在就相當於神
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.39,0:21:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不 應該是魔神
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.06,0:21:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,今後你們要叫我…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.42,0:22:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,撒旦大人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
